error[format_arg_count]: the format string uses 2 arguments but `print` is given 1 argument
  --> tests/lint/format_arg_count/bad.jai:10:17
   |
10 |     print("% is % years old\n", name);
   |                 ^ no argument for this
   |
   = help: pass a value for every `%`, or write `\%` for a percent sign
   = note: `format_arg_count` is `deny` by default

error[format_arg_count]: `print` is given 1 argument but the format string uses 0 arguments
  --> tests/lint/format_arg_count/bad.jai:11:21
   |
11 |     print("done\n", name);
   |                     ^^^^ not printed
   |
   = help: add a `%` for each argument, or remove the extra ones
   = note: `format_arg_count` is `deny` by default

